  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA HUMANITARIAN APPEAL FOR UKRAINE AND NEIGHBOURING COUNTRIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norway`s contribution to SHR and SGBV by UNFPA`s response to both IDP and refugee needs within Ukraine and in neighboring countries as found in UNFPA&#x2019;s component of the Ukraine Situation and Regional Refugee Response Plan lead by UNHCR. Funding for Ukraine is registered on this agreement in the official statistics, while funding for other neighbouring countries is recorded under QZA-22/0069-1 and QZA-22/0069-2.</narrative>
  </description>
